# Folders (and files) build.py should leave off the menu.
#
#   one name per line          Drafts
#   '#' starts a comment       # like this
#   wildcards work             *.bak
#   a bare name matches at any depth in the corpus
#   a name with a '/' is anchored to the corpus root:
#                              Huanglong Fables/Drafts
#
# Matching is case-insensitive. The app's own folders (Maqhaa Alsaahirat,
# Radio Nobody, Seven Grounds VN, .git, __pycache__, ...) are already skipped
# by SKIP_DIRS in build.py — this file is for everything else.
#
# Uncomment or add lines, then re-run:
#     python "Maqhaa Alsaahirat/build.py"

